"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1910148016:0":{"text":"쳇, 벌써 왔네...","source_cn":"嘁，这就找来了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB37C7193C3D7BB2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1910148017:0":{"text":"문 열어. 내가 한 일이니까 내가 책임질게!","source_cn":"把门打开，咱一人做事一人当！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE00F0A1F562940C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1910148018:0":{"text":"손님 여러분, 이건...","source_cn":"两位客人，这些是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB04FC8B82B6DFCF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1910148019:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(이)랑은 상관없어. 쟤는 아무것도 몰라!","source_cn":"不关<style=stress><player_nam...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6F403BCB8B89C4AB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(이)랑은 상관없어. 쟤는 아무것도 몰라!","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(이)랑은 상관없어. 쟤는 아무것도 몰라!","variant_male_record_index":"254288","variant_female_record_index":"254289","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1910148020:1":{"text":"욕을 하든 때리든, 아니면 쫓아내든 뭐라고 하려면 나한테 해. ","source_cn":"你们要是不爽，就罚咱一个人，要骂要打，还是要把咱赶走，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17CAD79BB6849706",