,"variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:33:1910148025:0":{"text":"엘피라는 기억을 더듬으며 모린에게 “일한 만큼 나눈다”는 개념을 설명했다...","source_cn":"艾菲拉依照记忆，磕磕绊绊地为沫霖解释了“按劳分配”的观念……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BF4FA4946347A19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1910148026:1":{"text":"그렇구나. 육지의 방식은 우리 바다 일족이랑 많이 다르네.","source_cn":"原来这是陆地的习惯，和海裔有很大差异呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18FAC8881E723945","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1910148027:1":{"text":"알았어. 내일 아침에 할머니께 말씀드릴 테니까 다시 사냥을 나가자.","source_cn":"我知道了，明天早上我和阿嬷说一声，我们再出去围猎一次。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CA4996C461C73FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1910148028:1":{"text":"응! 별일 없으면 우리는 이만 갈게. 너희도 일찍 쉬어.","source_cn":"嗯！既然没什么事，那我们先告辞了，你们也早点休息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA898DEE84CDA836","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1910148029:1":{"text":"...야, 잠깐. 진짜... 이렇게 간다고?","source_cn":"……喂，等一下！你……你们就这么走了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x628FFF9944C12728","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","d